  "description": "The storage gateway's request admission core: the request router, the operation allowlist and the folder guard that keep each tenant inside its own folder of a shared bucket (see ghost-platform-docs/21-storage-decision.md, 'The gateway, in outline').",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "dist/index.js",
  "scripts": {
